1
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:34,950
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,930
[Episode 10]

3
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:12,890
The nerve of you to show up.

4
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,220
Where did you take her?

5
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,310
Is she already dead?

6
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,310
Did you kill her?

7
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,420
Say something!

8
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:43,980
Raise your gun.

9
00:02:45,050 --> 00:02:45,800
Raise it!

10
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,020
Are you going to shoot me dead?

11
00:03:08,470 --> 00:03:09,990
You don't even know how to shoot.

12
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:11,870
You can't blow my head off with one shot.

13
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:12,960
You can't protect yourself,

14
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,490
yet you want to save others!

15
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,310
Listen up.

16
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,020
What's the use of a camera?

17
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:21,440
Can it turn into a bullet
that pierces through my skull?

18
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:23,430
Remember:

19
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,910
she is a Communist.

20
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,079
Stop thinking about her.

21
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,030
Otherwise,

22
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:31,230
I'll have to suspect
you're in league with her!

23
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:32,750
Yes!

24
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,800
I am!

25
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,630
I'm in league with her!

26
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,400
I'm also a Communist!

27
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:45,520
There's no Communist
as stupid as you in this world.

28
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:01,310
To me,

29
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:05,510
whether she is a Communist or not,

30
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:07,840
I don't care at all.

31
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:11,610
In these times,

32
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:15,480
aren't people's stances always changing?

33
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,339
When I met you,

34
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,970
you were protecting this country.

35
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:25,830
Now,

36
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,380
who is your gun protecting...

37
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,920
and who is it aimed at?

38
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,720
Right now,

39
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,330
before saving the country,

40
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,310
I have to save myself.

41
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:14,800
Even the heavens

42
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:18,160
wouldn't believe that.

43
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,960
Knowing Auntie for so long,

44
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,370
how have I never taken a picture of her?

45
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,120
Her picture wasn't taken,

46
00:05:50,890 --> 00:05:52,750
so why did she get sucked away too?

47
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:05,160
Spring thunder roars, all things grow.

48
00:06:05,350 --> 00:06:08,390
Today is The Awakening of Insects,
the 20th of the first lunar month.

49
00:06:08,390 --> 00:06:09,680
What a splendid day.

50
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,160
Get out.

51
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,400
Women shouldn't be so stubborn.

52
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,000
What you said,

53
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:25,120
even the God of Thunder wouldn't agree.

54
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,390
Have a safe trip.

55
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,280
Get out!

56
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,130
Then I'll take my leave.

57
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:49,920
Remember:

58
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:53,120
just stick with me
and you'll rise to the top

59
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,560
and live the high life with fine dining.

60
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,040
Fine dining?

61
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:03,070
Is it as good as Yangzhou fried rice?

62
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:04,390
Don't worry.

63
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:07,500
There's plenty of Yangzhou fried rice too.

64
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,240
Commendation Order,

65
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,360
Order No. 195.

66
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:32,720
Du Huangqiao of
the Special Operations Division

67
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:35,040
of the National Military Council

68
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:37,050
fought a fierce battle against the NBIS

69
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:38,980
during the operation to eliminate

70
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,850
the leaders of the 12th Branch.

71
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:42,250
Calm and decisive,

72
00:07:42,510 --> 00:07:43,600
wise and brave,

73
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:45,900
he thwarted the evil plots of the NBIS

74
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:47,870
and boosted the prestige of our army.

75
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:49,190
A special commendation is hereby issued

76
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,250
as encouragement.

77
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:52,000
Keep up the good work.

78
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,190
Cleaner,

79
00:07:54,230 --> 00:07:55,230
welcome back.

80
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:09,150
Only two bodies were found at the scene.

81
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,040
Look around again! Now!

82
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,950
Yes!

83
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:19,510
Maybe after obtaining the address,

84
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,120
that female Communist noticed something

85
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,320
and a fight broke out.

86
00:08:23,410 --> 00:08:25,740
The scene was burned beyond recognition.

87
00:08:26,790 --> 00:08:28,970
Only two charred bodies were found.

88
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,240
I don't believe

89
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,870
two men couldn't even handle

90
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:36,870
an injured woman.

91
00:08:38,549 --> 00:08:40,840
The men were sent by No. 76 in Hangzhou.

92
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,669
They were personally trained

93
00:08:42,669 --> 00:08:45,200
by Lu Xiaoguang, a Communist

94
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,600
who was recently turned.

95
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:47,550
He dreams of

96
00:08:48,270 --> 00:08:50,070
being transferred to Shanghai.

97
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,750
So he wouldn't have

98
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,550
sent losers over.

99
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,790
Maybe he messed up and fled,

100
00:08:57,790 --> 00:08:58,720
afraid of being

101
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,850
held accountable.

102
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:07,320
But I've been keeping an eye on him.

103
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,550
Not a word will leak out.

104
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:16,240
Although the Communist forces are small,

105
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,960
their ability cannot be underestimated.

106
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,320
The matter of the female Communist
is over.

107
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,450
It doesn't matter if she's dead or not.

108
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:25,110
But there's one thing

109
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:28,070
that's been weighing on my mind.

110
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,390
What is it?

111
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,900
During the rescue operation
at Renji Hospital,

112
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:37,280
two people from Operations also died.

113
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:40,480
That was definitely not done by my people.

114
00:09:40,530 --> 00:09:41,370
So,

115
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,280
the Communists were also
preparing a rescue operation.

116
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:46,080
They were just a step behind you.

117
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:51,480
You mean...

118
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:55,480
we have a mole in No. 76?

119
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,550
Mr. Zhao.

120
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:01,960
Who?

121
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,200
Zhao Qian.

122
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,980
He caught the Communist himself.

123
00:10:08,470 --> 00:10:09,700
I sent him there.

124
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:11,570
Look at you.

125
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,670
You've been Cleaner for so long that

126
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:16,400
you're unable to trust anyone.

127
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:19,870
Indeed.

128
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,790
It'd be horrifying if

129
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,490
he were a Communist.

130
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,550
To doubt our own,

131
00:10:24,910 --> 00:10:26,480
you need solid evidence.

132
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:29,140
He and Su Men aren't the same kind.

133
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,000
Su Men's your biggest worry.

134
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:40,390
Just one word from you,

135
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,060
and I can make her disappear anytime.

136
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:48,610
It's good to have you back.

137
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:51,600
In the current No. 76,

138
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:54,480
there are fewer and fewer people to trust,

139
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,030
and more and more

140
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,750
eyes watching me.

141
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:01,520
Well, there used to be Yu,
but it's a shame

142
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,580
he turned out to be a disappointment.

143
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:05,790
Has his ledger

144
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,560
been dealt with?

145
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,120
I had Yu Yingxiang

146
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:17,650
take the ledger to the bathhouse.

147
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:20,870
Kill him,

148
00:11:23,050 --> 00:11:24,510
and bring the ledger back.

149
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:33,540
Where's the ledger?

150
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,440
In the briefcase.

151
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:42,840
Are you... seeing me off?

152
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,670
Yes.

153
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:48,090
I'll personally send you on your way.

154
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,150
There were too many
prying eyes at Fairy Bath.

155
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:37,680
I was worried I'd lose the ledger,

156
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,680
so I destroyed it.

157
00:12:42,470 --> 00:12:43,800
Saving you back then was

158
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,000
the right choice.

159
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,600
You saved my life.

160
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:53,550
If you want it,

161
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:55,160
you can take it anytime.

162
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:03,920
You're awake.

163
00:13:15,470 --> 00:13:18,040
My wife and daughter are dead.

164
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:24,040
You should've let me die with them.

165
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:28,050
It's the party-state you serve

166
00:13:28,550 --> 00:13:29,610
that abandoned you

167
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,410
and your family.

168
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:18,630
Look.

169
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:22,730
The sun is so bright today.

170
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:28,960
All that happened yesterday

171
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:30,160
died with yesterday.

172
00:14:30,690 --> 00:14:31,950
All that happens today

173
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,150
lives with today.

174
00:14:35,050 --> 00:14:37,650
The Du Huangqiao
who lived for the party-state

175
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,600
died yesterday.

176
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,030
The new Du Huangqiao

177
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,150
should live

178
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:47,770
for himself from now on.

179
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:54,720
From today on,

180
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:58,440
I, Du Huangqiao,
will not only live for myself,

181
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:00,910
but also for you.

182
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,000
I believe in your capabilities.

183
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,560
And I believe in your loyalty even more.

184
00:15:18,030 --> 00:15:19,230
Now that you're back,

185
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,820
what position do you want?

186
00:15:21,730 --> 00:15:24,130
I'll follow your arrangements, Director.

187
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,470
Effective today,

188
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:30,250
you'll take the post

189
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:33,050
of Captain
of the Direct Action Brigade of No. 76.

190
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:44,350
Thank you, Director.

191
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,120
Director,

192
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,980
I'd like to bring someone else in.

193
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,120
Who?

194
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:53,600
Chen Kailai.

195
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:55,670
The photographer.

196
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:57,420
What use could

197
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,180
a photographer be?

198
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,150
He saved my life,

199
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,250
and I saved his.

200
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,910
We've been through
life and death together.

201
00:16:04,910 --> 00:16:05,840
He's very smart.

202
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,960
If I personally train him,

203
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:10,440
he could become a pillar of No. 76.

204
00:16:12,380 --> 00:16:14,510
You can decide who you want to recruit.

205
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:15,980
But before using anyone,

206
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:18,670
you must vet their background thoroughly.

207
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:19,960
Chen Kailai is

208
00:16:20,390 --> 00:16:21,600
very close to Su Men.

209
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:26,540
That's exactly one of the reasons
I want him.

210
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:30,440
Also,

211
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:35,000
Cang Guanglian will be under your command.

212
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:35,880
I know there's

213
00:16:36,310 --> 00:16:37,670
bad blood between you two,

214
00:16:37,670 --> 00:16:39,000
but you must understand

215
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:41,760
that you're both my right-hand men.

216
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,840
Rest assured, Director.

217
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,000
Big or small,

218
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,160
I know my priorities.

219
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:56,980
Inspector Su.

220
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:02,630
Captain Du, to think you'd even

221
00:17:02,970 --> 00:17:04,430
try to pull a fast one on me.

222
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:06,680
Inspector Su,

223
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,640
it's my fault.

224
00:17:10,270 --> 00:17:12,329
What I did behind the director's back

225
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:14,190
accidentally got you hurt.

226
00:17:15,069 --> 00:17:16,400
Punish me as you see fit.

227
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:20,240
What a loyal dog.

228
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,480
At the entrance of Fairy Bath,

229
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:27,670
there was a local dog named Yeller.

230
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:31,790
We used to be quite close.

231
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:33,570
Unfortunately, yesterday...

232
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:36,880
I accidentally got it hurt.

233
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,750
Then I hope you don't end up like it.

234
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:46,630
Thank you for your forgiveness,
Inspector Su.

235
00:17:52,090 --> 00:17:53,620
This lousy stormy weather—

236
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:55,080
it's going to rain again.

237
00:17:56,590 --> 00:17:57,480
The world is

238
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:59,830
full of unpredictable twists and turns.

239
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:01,030
When some succeed,

240
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:03,510
others fail.

241
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:07,450
If you're the one succeeding,

242
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:09,980
then I must be the one failing.

243
00:18:11,850 --> 00:18:13,180
That's not what I meant.

244
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:17,310
In the decades
since the fall of the Qing Dynasty,

245
00:18:17,310 --> 00:18:18,960
the rulers of this land have changed

246
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:19,890
again and again.

247
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,070
Today it's you.

248
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,480
Tomorrow it's me.

249
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:24,960
Who knows

250
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:27,350
who will have the last laugh?

251
00:18:29,530 --> 00:18:31,790
Who do you think it will be, Inspector Su?

252
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:37,160
Whoever lives the longest.

253
00:18:48,510 --> 00:18:50,040
Do what I said immediately.

254
00:18:50,350 --> 00:18:51,200
Rest assured, Director Li.

255
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:51,550
Understood?

256
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:52,310
Director Li.

257
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,140
Director Li, nice to meet you.

258
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,440
Congratulations.

259
00:18:59,410 --> 00:19:00,130
Congrats.

260
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:04,000
Welcome back, Captain Du.

261
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,530
Captain of the Direct Action Brigade.

262
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,880
When it comes to being well-informed,

263
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,490
it has to be you, Sachiko.

264
00:19:19,510 --> 00:19:22,510
You wiped out the 12th Branch of NBIS
in one fell swoop.

265
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:24,880
You're now the favorite of No. 76.

266
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:30,340
You also deserve some credit for this.

267
00:19:34,190 --> 00:19:35,450
I'm glad you remember.

268
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:37,270
Of course I do.

269
00:19:38,070 --> 00:19:39,600
If it weren't for your help,

270
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,750
how could I have gathered
the 12th Branch of NBIS

271
00:19:42,750 --> 00:19:44,350
all together?

272
00:19:58,070 --> 00:20:00,200
Sell this intel to the Hurricane Team.

273
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,220
What is this place?

274
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:11,120
The address of the Project Slumber lab.

275
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,840
They definitely want it.

276
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,920
From now on, I'll be

277
00:20:40,410 --> 00:20:42,170
counting on you at No. 76.

278
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:45,870
Rest assured.

279
00:20:46,570 --> 00:20:48,040
As long as I'm here,

280
00:20:48,590 --> 00:20:50,790
I'll take good care of you.

281
00:20:53,750 --> 00:20:54,480
Thank you.

282
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:06,210
A glass of wine.

283
00:21:13,510 --> 00:21:15,240
That blind man invited you too?

284
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,550
I'm not here for him.

285
00:21:18,830 --> 00:21:20,400
He's riding high right now.

286
00:21:20,510 --> 00:21:22,590
You now have a backer at No. 76.

287
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:23,590
Who cares?

288
00:21:25,790 --> 00:21:28,510
Mr. Zhao, you're really
smooth and tactful.

289
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,920
You can make friends with anyone.

290
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:33,030
The three of us have bathed together.

291
00:21:33,030 --> 00:21:34,160
It's a special bond.

292
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,320
How about a nickname for us?

293
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:38,610
The Three Heroes of the Bathhouse.

294
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,920
That's a good nickname!

295
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,570
What's so good about it?

296
00:21:46,350 --> 00:21:48,000
Fairy Bath's done anyway.

297
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,440
Don't worry.

298
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:54,640
I'll make sure

299
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:57,180
the "Fairy Bath" sign stands tall again.

300
00:21:57,270 --> 00:21:58,440
The sign is still there.

301
00:21:58,440 --> 00:22:00,400
It's just a pity about the boss.

302
00:22:02,350 --> 00:22:03,550
She's already dead.

303
00:22:04,070 --> 00:22:05,870
What's the use of dwelling on it?

304
00:22:06,550 --> 00:22:07,750
Who would've thought

305
00:22:08,350 --> 00:22:11,310
that such a wonderful person
was actually from the NBIS?

306
00:22:11,310 --> 00:22:12,710
And who would've thought

307
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:14,480
that a blind man is actually...

308
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:15,440
A traitor.

309
00:22:17,910 --> 00:22:18,630
Right?

310
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:24,680
I know.

311
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,920
You all think I was too heartless.

312
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,070
But in this world,

313
00:22:28,070 --> 00:22:30,470
life forces everyone's hand at some point.

314
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:32,280
She chose the wrong side,

315
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,440
so death is her best ending.

316
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:35,680
I understand.

317
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,620
Letting her suffer less is

318
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:39,920
also your way of looking out for her.

319
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,650
Ridiculous.

320
00:22:42,030 --> 00:22:44,290
Killing someone is looking out for them?

321
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:45,830
You lot are insane.

322
00:22:49,070 --> 00:22:50,870
I was like him when I was younger.

323
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:09,550
Mr. Zhao, you've been sandbagging.

324
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:12,920
You caught that female Communist.

325
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:14,640
It was pure luck.

326
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:18,660
Director Li specifically asked me
to make up the numbers that day.

327
00:23:19,550 --> 00:23:20,410
I realized that

328
00:23:22,030 --> 00:23:23,550
as long as it's about the Communists,

329
00:23:23,550 --> 00:23:26,310
you're particularly attentive.

330
00:23:27,350 --> 00:23:28,070
Wait.

331
00:23:28,750 --> 00:23:29,550
What's wrong?

332
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,070
You reminded me.

333
00:23:31,070 --> 00:23:33,510
Why am I not included
in this batch of commendations?

334
00:23:33,510 --> 00:23:36,240
Could the credit have
all gone to Cang Guanglian?

335
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:37,920
Li Moqun

336
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:41,440
and Du the Blind...

337
00:23:47,070 --> 00:23:49,440
They teamed up to play me.

338
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:52,440
One Yu Yingxiang wasn't enough.

339
00:23:53,070 --> 00:23:55,000
They even sent a female Communist.

340
00:23:58,130 --> 00:23:59,260
In all this,

341
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:01,720
I'm the only fool,

342
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,640
being played like a fiddle.

343
00:24:05,270 --> 00:24:06,960
Especially that Du the Blind,

344
00:24:07,730 --> 00:24:09,290
he's just a dog.

345
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:12,830
Come on.

346
00:24:13,790 --> 00:24:15,680
Let's drink up today.

347
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:37,270
May I have this dance?

348
00:24:39,310 --> 00:24:41,370
With your dancing skills? No thanks.

349
00:24:46,550 --> 00:24:47,750
What did you capture?

350
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,530
My miserable state?

351
00:24:54,510 --> 00:24:56,370
I don't think you look miserable.

352
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:59,100
Sometimes people look better

353
00:24:59,510 --> 00:25:00,770
when they don't smile.

354
00:25:04,420 --> 00:25:05,750
That's not a bad answer.

355
00:25:07,510 --> 00:25:09,110
Then can I ask you something?

356
00:25:16,550 --> 00:25:18,280
I know what you're going to ask.

357
00:25:19,590 --> 00:25:20,720
Is she really dead?

358
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,800
It's already in the newspapers.

359
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:29,920
Newspaper headlines change every day.

360
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:32,000
But I believe

361
00:25:32,260 --> 00:25:33,020
your words.

362
00:25:40,310 --> 00:25:41,200
She's dead.

363
00:26:06,590 --> 00:26:07,520
What did she say?

364
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:10,310
She's dead.

365
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:31,780
The dead cannot come back to life.

366
00:26:33,350 --> 00:26:34,200
But we must

367
00:26:35,590 --> 00:26:37,250
keep the grudge in our hearts.

368
00:26:42,510 --> 00:26:43,510
It's all my fault.

369
00:27:12,550 --> 00:27:14,610
It's my fault that there isn't a photo

370
00:27:16,070 --> 00:27:16,920
of Auntie.

371
00:27:21,510 --> 00:27:22,920
It's also my fault

372
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,130
that my cousin died.

373
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:39,660
I shouldn't have trusted that blind man.

374
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:56,750
Let's not cry.

375
00:28:01,110 --> 00:28:02,790
The living must live well.

376
00:28:04,830 --> 00:28:06,350
We must live well for them.

377
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:24,510
Boss, Cang Guanglian's here.

378
00:28:24,590 --> 00:28:25,720
He's in your office.

379
00:28:29,070 --> 00:28:30,590
I told his fortune before.

380
00:28:31,030 --> 00:28:32,750
If he wants to live to 89,

381
00:28:33,070 --> 00:28:34,480
he must beware of people

382
00:28:34,480 --> 00:28:36,340
with "shu (tree)" in their names.

383
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:28,970
I've lived my whole life

384
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,700
with eyes that don't work.

385
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:34,770
Battalion Commander,

386
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:35,760
please...

387
00:29:36,550 --> 00:29:37,680
please punish me.

388
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:42,790
I wronged you in the past.

389
00:29:46,430 --> 00:29:49,670
That day, I rushed back
to the camp for reinforcements.

390
00:29:50,820 --> 00:29:52,820
But there was no one left in the camp.

391
00:29:53,930 --> 00:29:55,570
Everyone was afraid of death

392
00:29:55,920 --> 00:29:57,350
and ran away.

393
00:30:01,750 --> 00:30:02,750
Get up!

394
00:30:04,750 --> 00:30:05,480
Take it!

395
00:30:10,550 --> 00:30:11,270
Later,

396
00:30:12,270 --> 00:30:13,960
I took my gun to go save you.

397
00:30:16,200 --> 00:30:17,530
But as soon as I went out,

398
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:20,350
I ran into the Japanese.

399
00:30:36,420 --> 00:30:37,680
Battalion Commander.

400
00:30:38,750 --> 00:30:40,720
I misunderstood you.

401
00:30:43,270 --> 00:30:44,530
Battalion Commander,

402
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:47,200
from now on, whatever your orders are,

403
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:50,200
I will never say no!

404
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:14,750
What if I order you

405
00:31:16,510 --> 00:31:18,070
to swallow these right now?

406
00:31:21,860 --> 00:31:22,820
Swallow them!

407
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:42,240
Buddy,

408
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,790
if you make too big a deal out of this,

409
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:50,350
you're insulting me.

410
00:31:51,190 --> 00:31:53,710
I was just joking with you.

411
00:31:55,310 --> 00:31:56,350
In this world,

412
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:58,590
many things

413
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,510
are just meant to be.

414
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:04,240
Take us for example.

415
00:32:07,110 --> 00:32:08,030
We are

416
00:32:08,830 --> 00:32:11,960
brothers who braved death together
on the battlefield!

417
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:14,880
What you need to do now

418
00:32:16,070 --> 00:32:17,590
is to forget everything

419
00:32:18,590 --> 00:32:21,030
about Nanjing and the bathhouse!

420
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:28,590
It was all just a joke.

421
00:32:29,590 --> 00:32:30,550
Because

422
00:32:31,590 --> 00:32:34,270
life forces everyone's hand at some point.

423
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,030
Am I right?

424
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,960
Battalion Commander...

425
00:32:52,750 --> 00:32:53,430
Pal.

426
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:56,070
I need you to do something for me.

427
00:32:56,560 --> 00:32:58,360
Commander, just give the order.

428
00:32:58,960 --> 00:32:59,960
Keep an eye on him.

429
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,130
From now on,

430
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:33,970
no one is to mention Auntie again.

431
00:33:35,480 --> 00:33:37,140
Isn't she like a sister to you?

432
00:33:40,790 --> 00:33:41,960
Only those who

433
00:33:42,250 --> 00:33:43,610
[Xiaoxian]

434
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:43,460
forget the dead

435
00:33:43,830 --> 00:33:45,350
can go on living.

436
00:33:46,510 --> 00:33:47,270
You too.

437
00:34:03,500 --> 00:34:04,390
Du the Blind,

438
00:34:05,550 --> 00:34:07,410
don't shed crocodile tears here.

439
00:34:07,830 --> 00:34:08,830
It's disgusting.

440
00:34:15,230 --> 00:34:16,000
Wait.

441
00:34:19,230 --> 00:34:20,030
Take this.

442
00:34:23,670 --> 00:34:24,929
I have enough clothes.

443
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:28,150
Enough for the photo studio,

444
00:34:28,150 --> 00:34:29,630
but not for No. 76.

445
00:34:31,630 --> 00:34:33,110
Why would I go to No. 76?

446
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:37,000
I told you

447
00:34:37,590 --> 00:34:39,190
our hard times are over.

448
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:42,590
Join me at No. 76 and live the high life.

449
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:45,760
That's you.

450
00:34:47,190 --> 00:34:48,190
That shark tank

451
00:34:48,190 --> 00:34:49,670
is not a place for me.

452
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,710
It's precisely

453
00:34:51,710 --> 00:34:53,150
because it's a shark tank

454
00:34:53,150 --> 00:34:53,880
that

455
00:34:54,070 --> 00:34:55,760
I need you there with me.

456
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:57,070
Why?

457
00:34:58,800 --> 00:35:00,800
Because I can't trust anyone there.

458
00:35:02,070 --> 00:35:03,190
I only trust you.

459
00:35:04,490 --> 00:35:06,150
But I don't trust you anymore.

460
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,710
You don't understand

461
00:35:15,110 --> 00:35:16,240
people or politics.

462
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:18,800
You'll suffer in the outside world.

463
00:35:18,960 --> 00:35:19,960
Like I said,

464
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:23,250
following the right person is important.

465
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,150
And like I said,

466
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,230
I'm just a photographer.

467
00:35:28,670 --> 00:35:29,930
I don't follow anyone.

468
00:35:32,590 --> 00:35:34,110
Think it over again.

469
00:35:41,840 --> 00:35:43,570
Unless you tie me up and take me.

470
00:35:45,710 --> 00:35:47,030
I'm a blind man

471
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:48,700
who can tell fortunes.

472
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,960
I foresee that one day,

473
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:53,360
you'll come begging me.

474
00:35:56,630 --> 00:35:57,400
Impossible.

475
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:19,650
Boss, you're back.

476
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:21,400
Mr. Zhao sent someone to deliver this,

477
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:23,660
saying it's to pay respects to Xiaoxian.

478
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:26,130
People from No. 76 have no conscience.

479
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:27,900
They're all accomplices.

480
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,560
Get rid of it right away.

481
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,280
The departed

482
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:42,260
deserve remembrance.

483
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:44,110
Put them in a vase.

484
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:44,800
By the way,

485
00:36:45,070 --> 00:36:47,600
I left the newspaper you ordered
on the stand.

486
00:36:47,670 --> 00:36:48,550
Newspaper?

487
00:36:48,760 --> 00:36:49,510
The Shen Bao.

488
00:36:49,670 --> 00:36:51,470
The newsboy said you ordered it.

489
00:37:37,150 --> 00:37:37,800
Captain,

490
00:37:38,510 --> 00:37:41,190
Mr. Zhao either goes to the dance hall
or eats out.

491
00:37:41,190 --> 00:37:42,800
Except for different female companions,

492
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,660
I haven't seen anything unusual.

493
00:37:45,470 --> 00:37:48,800
That Du guy is deliberately
making things difficult for me.

494
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:51,110
He just gives me useless crap to do.

495
00:37:56,720 --> 00:37:57,850
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

496
00:38:05,510 --> 00:38:06,510
Surnamed Su,

497
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:07,880
cousin,

498
00:38:08,550 --> 00:38:09,960
the 25th,

499
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:12,220
went missing in the bathhouse...

500
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:17,760
No. 13, Yaoshuinong Shantytown,
South Bank of Suzhou Creek.

501
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,070
Rickshaw!

502
00:38:25,480 --> 00:38:28,070
To Yaoshuinong Shantytown,
South Bank of Suzhou Creek.

503
00:38:28,070 --> 00:38:28,760
Okay, sir.

504
00:38:28,790 --> 00:38:29,500
Sit tight.

505
00:38:32,710 --> 00:38:33,400
Well...

506
00:38:38,190 --> 00:38:40,000
Mr. Zhao, what a coincidence.

507
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:41,360
You came alone?

508
00:38:41,630 --> 00:38:42,760
Didn't bring a date?

509
00:38:43,330 --> 00:38:44,690
I'm not like you,

510
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,850
having a date with a beauty.

511
00:38:48,070 --> 00:38:50,190
How can you come here without a date?

512
00:38:56,630 --> 00:38:58,280
Do you know Lillian?

513
00:38:58,740 --> 00:39:00,190
Now, she's the most sought-after
in all of Shanghai.

514
00:39:00,190 --> 00:39:01,790
I'll help you jump the queue.

515
00:39:02,150 --> 00:39:03,210
He's Captain Cang.

516
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:05,960
Mr. Zhao and I are old friends.

517
00:39:06,720 --> 00:39:09,030
Mr. Zhao's friends are my friends.

518
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:13,280
Miss Lillian,

519
00:39:14,070 --> 00:39:15,630
I've heard so much about you.

520
00:39:15,630 --> 00:39:16,480
Captain Cang,

521
00:39:16,830 --> 00:39:17,660
let's dance.

522
00:39:24,670 --> 00:39:26,030
Mr. Zhao, join us.

523
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,200
You go have fun.

524
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:34,000
I'll order some drinks.

525
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:35,060
I'll be right back.

526
00:39:35,190 --> 00:39:36,120
I'll be waiting.

527
00:39:56,230 --> 00:39:56,880
Hello?

528
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:21,210
♪ Rose, oh rose, most lovely ♪

529
00:40:21,250 --> 00:40:25,330
♪ Rose, oh rose, most ravishing ♪

530
00:40:25,570 --> 00:40:29,710
♪ Blooming upon branches
through long summer days ♪

531
00:40:29,730 --> 00:40:33,970
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

532
00:40:33,990 --> 00:40:38,530
♪ Rose, oh rose, your sentiment profound ♪

533
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,590
How dare you, Cang Guanglian!

534
00:40:38,550 --> 00:40:42,180
♪ Rose, oh rose, your affection deep ♪

535
00:40:38,670 --> 00:40:39,840
Didn't you say you had a mission?

536
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:41,480
So you came here for this vixen!

537
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:42,440
No, no.

538
00:40:42,440 --> 00:40:43,030
Stop right there!

539
00:40:42,600 --> 00:40:46,730
♪ Blooming through the summer
amid the thorns ♪

540
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:44,880
I really have a mission.

541
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:46,550
You lied to me again! Move!

542
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:49,000
Who the hell are you? Where are you from?

543
00:40:46,900 --> 00:40:50,970
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

544
00:40:49,560 --> 00:40:50,440
What's your name?

545
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:51,440
Let me look at you!

546
00:40:51,460 --> 00:40:55,500
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

547
00:40:51,510 --> 00:40:52,810
Let them handle their family affairs.

548
00:40:52,810 --> 00:40:53,590
We'll just dance.

549
00:40:53,590 --> 00:40:54,960
Why were you dancing with him?

550
00:40:54,960 --> 00:40:56,070
Alright, alright!

551
00:40:55,650 --> 00:40:59,320
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

552
00:40:56,070 --> 00:40:57,190
Let's go home. We'll talk at home.

553
00:40:57,190 --> 00:40:58,320
What home?

554
00:40:58,320 --> 00:40:59,580
Let's go home. Come on!

555
00:40:59,850 --> 00:41:03,880
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

556
00:41:01,230 --> 00:41:02,190
Let go of me!

557
00:41:03,760 --> 00:41:04,630
Let go!

558
00:41:04,050 --> 00:41:08,530
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

559
00:41:09,470 --> 00:41:13,810
♪ Rose, oh rose, slender are your stems ♪

560
00:41:10,030 --> 00:41:11,320
Cang told me a couple of days ago

561
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:12,920
that he wanted to ask you out.

562
00:41:13,190 --> 00:41:14,000
Maybe he followed us

563
00:41:13,840 --> 00:41:17,560
♪ Rose, oh rose, sharp are your thorns ♪

564
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:15,400
here on purpose today.

565
00:41:17,730 --> 00:41:19,400
No wonder you paired him up

566
00:41:18,100 --> 00:41:22,230
♪ Wind and rain may come to ravage today ♪

567
00:41:19,400 --> 00:41:20,460
with that Lillian.

568
00:41:21,630 --> 00:41:22,840
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

569
00:41:22,250 --> 00:41:26,720
♪ Bruising the tender twigs
and dainty petals ♪

570
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,070
To me,

571
00:41:24,590 --> 00:41:26,190
you'll always be number one.

572
00:41:26,750 --> 00:41:30,480
♪ Rose, oh rose, steadfast is your heart ♪

573
00:41:27,030 --> 00:41:28,230
I don't believe that.

574
00:41:28,670 --> 00:41:29,880
Your acting's so good

575
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:31,320
that you even fooled
that female Communist.

576
00:41:30,500 --> 00:41:34,830
♪ Rose, oh rose,
piercing are your prickles ♪

577
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:33,880
It's a pity you didn't see
my performance that day

578
00:41:33,880 --> 00:41:34,960
with your own eyes.

579
00:41:34,850 --> 00:41:38,870
♪ Though future storms
may come to batter the blossoms ♪

580
00:41:39,140 --> 00:41:43,300
♪ They cannot destroy the branches
that intertwine as one ♪

581
00:41:39,230 --> 00:41:40,160
I was excellent.

582
00:41:41,800 --> 00:41:43,070
How did you do it?

583
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:44,760
I've never seen anyone

584
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:46,420
who could imitate her so well.

585
00:41:46,590 --> 00:41:50,790
♪ Rose, oh rose, most lovely ♪

586
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:48,450
Who said I haven't seen her?

587
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:51,190
General Kagesa arranged for me to see her

588
00:41:51,020 --> 00:41:55,050
♪ Rose, oh rose, most ravishing ♪

589
00:41:51,190 --> 00:41:52,670
at the Plum Blossom Agency.

590
00:41:52,670 --> 00:41:53,510
Otherwise,

591
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:55,480
I wouldn't have been able to

592
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:59,350
♪ Blooming upon branches
through long summer days ♪

593
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:58,810
replicate the elegant temperament
of that Shanghai woman.

594
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:01,230
There aren't many elegant women
left in Shanghai.

595
00:41:59,460 --> 00:42:03,710
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

596
00:42:02,230 --> 00:42:03,630
It's a pity for her to die.

597
00:42:03,950 --> 00:42:07,970
♪ Rose, oh rose, your sentiment profound ♪

598
00:42:05,510 --> 00:42:07,710
I doubt the Japanese would kill her.

599
00:42:07,990 --> 00:42:12,030
♪ Rose, oh rose, your affection deep ♪

600
00:42:09,400 --> 00:42:11,260
She comes from a powerful family.

601
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,440
Her father does business in Japan.

602
00:42:12,500 --> 00:42:16,670
♪ Blooming through the summer
amid the thorns ♪

603
00:42:14,590 --> 00:42:16,590
I heard his business is quite large.

604
00:42:16,690 --> 00:42:20,850
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

605
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:19,420
The Japanese are still
somewhat wary of him.

606
00:42:20,510 --> 00:42:21,960
Is she still at the Plum Blossom Agency?

607
00:42:21,120 --> 00:42:25,400
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

608
00:42:22,710 --> 00:42:26,070
You seem to be very interested in her.

609
00:42:25,430 --> 00:42:29,500
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

610
00:42:27,070 --> 00:42:29,280
I figured she must be very beautiful,

611
00:42:29,530 --> 00:42:33,600
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

612
00:42:30,590 --> 00:42:32,990
or they wouldn't have
asked you to play her.

613
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:38,010
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

614
00:42:34,590 --> 00:42:36,630
You sure know how to
catch people off guard

615
00:42:36,630 --> 00:42:38,490
with those compliments of yours.

616
00:42:39,330 --> 00:42:43,740
♪ Rose, oh rose, slender are your stems ♪

617
00:42:51,810 --> 00:42:52,800
Sir, stop here.

618
00:42:57,110 --> 00:42:57,770
Here you go.

619
00:42:58,320 --> 00:42:59,110
Thank you, sir.
